    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Horse Plinko, the most unhinged way to win big with horses.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Imagine classic Plinko, but instead of plastic discs, you're dropping full-on horses. It\u2019s chaotic, it\u2019s hilarious, and somehow... it works.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horse Plinko is a ridiculous physics-based game where strategy meets slapstick. Score points, unlock upgrades, and discover just how far one horse can fall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In Horse Plinko you will:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drop Horses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make Money</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy Upgrades in the Shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige at the Shrine</p></li></ul>",
